* Nine unsimulated front buffers: explicit nominal 1.3mA DC rail load EACH.
* This load is an assumption, not a full ten-channel coupling simulation.
Iother v5afe vn3 11.7m

XU9 v5afe ref_temp 0 nr ref25 REF5025
C103 v5afe 0 1u
C105 nr 0 1u
R201 ref25 ref_esr 1
C104 ref_esr 0 4.7u
R202 ref25 off_filt 15.8k
R203 off_filt 0 10k
C158 off_filt 0 4.7u
XU32 off_filt off_buf v5afe 0 off_buf OPAx189
C160 v5afe 0 100n
R204 off_buf off 1k
C159 off 0 4.7u
* Nine other OPA320 + input capacitances approximated by 4pF each.
Cother off 0 36p

* Actual J2 values; source resistance is generator, not board termination.
Vsig_j2 src_j2 0 DC 0 AC 1
Rsource_j2 src_j2 raw_j2 50
R177_j2 raw_j2 0 100000
R140_j2 raw_j2 filt_j2 3320
C97_j2 filt_j2 0 10n
XU20_j2 filt_j2 buf_j2 v5afe vn3 buf_j2 OPAx189
C120_j2 v5afe 0 100n
C121_j2 vn3 0 100n
R137_j2 buf_j2 sum_j2 4000
XU10_j2 off sum_j2 v3 0 drv_j2 OPAx320
C100_j2 v3 0 100n
R187_j2 sum_j2 drv_j2 2800
C122_j2 sum_j2 drv_j2 10n
R141_j2 drv_j2 adc_j2 47
C80_j2 adc_j2 0 10n

.noise V(adc_j2) Vsig_j2 dec 120 .1 100Meg
